N:HOW READ (2026-11-11): Every bar totals eight eighth units. Bars 1 and 3: four quarter notes E-E-G-E; bars 2 and 4: four paired eighths G-E-D-C followed by C half; bars 5 and 6: paired eighths plus quarters; bar 7 four quarters; bar 8 C half and half rest. Pitch set C-D-E-G, range C4-G4, largest leap a fourth, form AABB.
N:UNCERTAIN: Catchiness, safe movement pacing, lyric clarity and the best ending choices await a classroom trial. A second reader must compare the hook with the listening reference and common greeting songs.
